jobs.description:
We are looking for a Logistics Reception & Expedition Employee for our logistics department. In this versatile role, you will be the first point of contact for drivers and ensure that incoming and outgoing goods flow smoothly and correctly.

- Receiving and registering drivers and visitors;
- Coordinating incoming and outgoing goods;
- Checking freight documents and transport documentation;
- Administrative processing in the logistics system;
- Managing loading and unloading processes;
- Assisting with loading and unloading;
- Ensuring order, cleanliness, and safety in the dispatch area.

- Experience in a logistics role;
- Experience with an EPT, forklift, or reach truck;
- Good communication skills;
- Accurate and stress-resistant work ethic;
- Basic knowledge of MS Office and logistics systems;
- You speak the English language.

SamenvattingStart as an Order Picker in Nieuwegein and make sure Albert Heijn supermarkets receive their products on time. Earn €14.99 gross per hour and allowances for working in shifts. Stay active throughout your working day, work with a friendly team, and make a difference every day. Good work!Over de functieAs an Orderpicker at this logistics organization in Nieuwegein, you make sure supermarkets receive their fresh products every day. Using a modern voice-picking system, available in Dutch, English, Polish, and Ukrainian, you collect orders in the warehouse. You walk a lot, pick products from shelves, and prepare orders for transport. You work quickly and accurately, because the stores depend on you. The job takes place in a refrigerated environment (around 4°C), so it’s important you are comfortable with cooler temperatures. You’ll receive clear instructions through the voice-picking system so you know exactly which products to collect.
Your tasks:
- Collecting products using a voice-picking system;
- Preparing and organizing trolleys for shipment;
- Checking product quantities and quality.

This job is for 40 hours per week. Your shifts will be scheduled as follows:
- Morning shift: 05:00–14:30
- Night shift: 19:30–04:00

Over het bedrijfAt your new workplace in Nieuwegein, you’ll work alongside colleagues from different countries towards one shared goal: making sure supermarkets across the Netherlands receive their fresh products on time. The atmosphere is friendly and welcoming. Colleagues help each other when needed, chat during breaks, and always have time for a joke. Together, you contribute to something that people rely on every day.
Wat wij vragen- You have your own accomodation in The Netherlands. For this job we don't provide housing;
- You speak Dutch, English, or Polish;
- You’re physically fit and able to perform physical work;
- You’re comfortable working in a chilled environment (around 4°C);
- You’re flexible and willing to work week

SamenvattingDo you enjoy being active and like the idea of ​​being part of DHL? Then be sure to read on and discover what this job has to offer. Good work! Over de functieThis role is ideal if you enjoy being active and like variety.
Your responsibilities:
- Sorting and scanning parcels;
- Loading and unloading shipments;
- Working on the conveyor belt;
- Handling parcels of various sizes and weights;
- Supporting efficient daily warehouse operations.

The warehouse worker position involves working in a two-shift system. The working hours are 15:00/17:00-23:00, 17:00-02:30, 23:00-07:00. It is a job for 24–32 hours per week. 
Over het bedrijfYour new employer, DHL, is an essential link in the global logistics process. Packages are sorted, shipped, and delivered in more than 200 countries. You will be working at the Amsterdam location. You will work in a modern environment and be part of a driven and motivated team. 
Wat wij vragenYou have your own accomodation in the Netherlands; 
Good command of the Dutch or English language;
Performing physical work is no problem for you;
You are motivated, work well in a team, and are accurate;
You are available to work flexibly in a two-shift system.

Of course, these points are essential for the role of order picker, but we are primarily interested in who you are! Inspire us.

Wat wij biedenA salary of €14,99 gross per hour;
Shift allowance:125% → from 20:00 to 24:00
130% → from 00:00 to 07:00;

Weekend allowance:+50% on Saturdays
+100% on Sundays

Travel allowance up to €13,80 per day;
Extra money when you work overtime: 150%.

Meer informatieApplying only takes 2 minutes. Do you have any questions? Kamila will be happy to anwser them on:+31625477379 or k.spiewak@carriere.com Good work!
